Z||000010||72vinman||12-21-2001||12:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRiAD:<BR><B>If this is a club, make me a LIFE member!<P>TWO BIG thumbs up!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ditto!<BR>I can't wait to try this. I have not picked up my mail in 4 days. I should have a lot of great stuff to work with.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
